---
alwaysApply: true
---
This repo uses a staged ticket-development pipeline (SmartDeveloper). Ticket state
lives in `.dev-agent/{ticket-id}/` (`pipeline.json` plus numbered artifacts). Agents
always read prior-stage files before starting their stage, and never skip ahead to a
later stage's file. Never proceed past a human gate without explicit go-ahead in the
conversation. The plan gate (stage 3) and the PR gate (stage 7) are required, not
optional, regardless of ticket size.
